{"title":"Career roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses and interprets data to help organisations make better business decisions. The role combines commerce/business knowledge with statistics, SQL, Excel, data visualisation and increasingly Python and AI tools.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"B.Com","Course":"Computer Applications","Timeline assumption":"3- or 4-year B.Com pathway depending on the university. If the student follows a 4-year honours/research structure, use the additional year for advanced analytics, internships and a research/project portfolio."},"about":[{"label":"Primary skills","text":"Excel, SQL, statistics, data cleaning, Power BI/Tableau, business analysis"},{"label":"Advanced skills","text":"Python, pandas, automation, predictive analytics, AI-assisted analytics"},{"label":"Business advantage","text":"Accounting, finance, economics and business-process understanding"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Data Analyst Intern, BI Intern, Reporting Analyst Intern, Business Analyst Intern"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Junior Data Analyst, Data Analyst, BI Analyst, Business/Data Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Data Analyst, Senior BI Analyst, Product/Data Analyst, Analytics Consultant"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Analytics Lead, BI Lead, Analytics Manager, Data Strategy Manager"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com Computer Applications student, this is a strong interdisciplinary pathway because the degree can provide both business/accounting knowledge and foundational computing skills. To become employable as a Data Analyst, the student should deliberately build a stronger technical analytics layer around the degree."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Computer Applications","Data Analytics Internship","Data Analyst Trainee / Junior Data Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead / BI Lead / Analytics Manager"],"label":"Career route"}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Excel + business mathematics"},{"text":"Microsoft Excel","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"text":"Sales/finance analysis workbook"},{"text":"Digital + quantitative"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Statistics + data fundamentals"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Descriptive-statistics project"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"SQLBolt","url":"https://sqlbolt.com/"},{"text":"50+ SQL queries on a relational dataset"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Power BI + data visualisation"},{"text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"},{"text":"BI readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python + pandas"},{"text":"Python documentation + pandas","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"text":"End-to-end Python analysis"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + business analytics"},{"text":"Employer + real datasets"},{"text":"Internship + 2 business case studies"},{"text":"Industry readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced analytics + portfolio"},{"text":"Python/SQL/BI resources"},{"text":"4–5 polished projects"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Interview + applications"},{"text":"Mock interviews + case studies"},{"text":"Portfolio + applications"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Data Analyst stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulas"},{"text":"Relative/absolute references"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"SUMIFS/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Text functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Pivot charts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Basic dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com student, Excel should become a major strength, particularly for finance and business analytics."}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is one of the most important technical skills for a Data Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"DISTINCT"},{"text":"CASE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Joins"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"INNER JOIN"},{"text":"LEFT JOIN"},{"text":"RIGHT JOIN"},{"text":"FULL JOIN"},{"text":"Self joins"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced SQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"ROW_NUMBER"},{"text":"RANK"},{"text":"DENSE_RANK"},{"text":"LAG"},{"text":"LEAD"},{"text":"Running totals"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Date functions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Database concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary keys"},{"text":"Foreign keys"},{"text":"Normalisation"},{"text":"Indexes"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Views"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate should be comfortable answering business questions directly from a database."}]},{"heading":"Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Covariance"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Outlier detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Later add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Experimental design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply calculating statistics but understanding what the statistic means for a business decision."}]},{"heading":"Power BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data import"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Calculated columns"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Drill-down"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Slicers"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Report publishing"},{"text":"Row-level security concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Supply chain"}]}]},{"heading":"Python","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Python is not always mandatory for an entry-level Data Analyst, but it significantly expands the student's opportunities."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python syntax"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Lists/dictionaries"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Basic statistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"NumPy · Matplotlib","url":"https://numpy.org/"},{"type":"p","text":"Then learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Grouping"},{"text":"Merging"},{"text":"Reshaping"},{"text":"Feature creation"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Automated reports"}]}]},{"heading":"Business analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst should understand the business question before touching the data."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business KPIs"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Margin"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Operational efficiency"},{"text":"Cost analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a commerce graduate, this business foundation is a major advantage."}]},{"heading":"Data storytelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good analyst should answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"What happened?"},{"type":"p","text":"Why did it happen?"},{"type":"p","text":"What is likely to happen next?"},{"type":"p","text":"What should the business do?"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to convert:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw data","Analysis","Insight","Recommendation","Business action"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid producing dashboards that only display numbers without explaining their implications."},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build during B.Com"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Retail sales dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use a public/synthetic dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Regions"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Discounts"},{"text":"Profit"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel/Power BI","Dashboard","Business recommendations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Financial performance dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly suitable for B.Com."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Expenses"},{"text":"Gross profit"},{"text":"Net profit"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Profit margin"},{"text":"Expense categories"},{"text":"Year-on-year growth"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build an executive dashboard in Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Customer churn analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer demographics"},{"text":"Usage"},{"text":"Purchase history"},{"text":"Subscription duration"},{"text":"Churn status"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who is leaving?"},{"text":"Why are they leaving?"},{"text":"Which segment has the highest churn?"},{"text":"What factors correlate with churn?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — E-commerce analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Repeat purchase"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Cart abandonment"},{"text":"Revenue by channel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Banking analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a hypothetical banking dataset and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer deposits"},{"text":"Loans"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Loan defaults"},{"text":"Branch performance"},{"text":"Product usage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This combines the student's commerce + analytics background."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Python EDA"},{"type":"p","text":"Use a public dataset and demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data collection","Cleaning","EDA","Visualisation","Statistical analysis","Insights"]},{"type":"p","text":"Publish the notebook on GitHub."},{"type":"p","text":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/"},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio standard"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for at least:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3 SQL projects"},{"text":"3 Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"2 Excel projects"},{"text":"2 Python/pandas projects"},{"text":"2 business case studies"},{"text":"1 internship project"},{"text":"1 end-to-end capstone"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The projects should answer real business questions rather than simply demonstrate tool features."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Excel + Power BI"},{"text":"NPTEL + Microsoft resources"},{"text":"Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Finance + Excel + SQL + Power BI"},{"text":"Finance + analytics resources"},{"text":"Financial Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"BI Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + data modelling"},{"text":"Microsoft resources"},{"text":"BI Lead"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + statistics + experimentation"},{"text":"Analytics resources"},{"text":"Product Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + statistics + digital metrics"},{"text":"Analytics resources"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Risk Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics + finance + SQL/Python"},{"text":"Finance/risk resources"},{"text":"Risk Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Operations Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Excel + BI + optimisation"},{"text":"Operations resources"},{"text":"Operations Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics + HR metrics + BI"},{"text":"HR analytics resources"},{"text":"People Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Data Quality"},{"text":"SQL + databases + data governance"},{"text":"Database resources"},{"text":"Data Quality Lead"}],[{"text":"Analytics Engineering"},{"text":"SQL + data modelling + Git + cloud"},{"text":"Data engineering resources"},{"text":"Analytics Engineer"}],[{"text":"AI-Augmented Analytics"},{"text":"Python + SQL + AI + BI"},{"text":"Python/AI resources"},{"text":"AI Analytics Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Basic reporting and repetitive dashboard generation will increasingly be automated."},{"type":"p","text":"A future-proof Data Analyst should move from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting","Analysis","Prediction","Decision Intelligence"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Natural-language querying"},{"text":"Automated data preparation"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Causal analysis"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Analytics engineering"},{"text":"Cloud data platforms"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"AI agents for analytics"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business domain expertise","SQL","statistics","BI","Python","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree specifically, an excellent combination would be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","Finance","SQL","Power BI","Python","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector / research exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"NITI Aayog"},{"text":"Policy and data analysis"}],[{"text":"MoSPI"},{"text":"Statistics and official data"}],[{"text":"RBI"},{"text":"Banking, financial and economic data"}],[{"text":"SEBI"},{"text":"Securities-market data and financial research"}],[{"text":"Public-sector banks"},{"text":"Financial/customer/operations analytics"}],[{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"MIS and programme analytics"}],[{"text":"NIC"},{"text":"Government information systems and data"}],[{"text":"IIT/IIM/university research groups"},{"text":"Statistics, economics and applied research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"NITI Aayog · MoSPI · RBI · SEBI · NIC","url":"https://www.niti.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Marketing technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accenture","url":"https://www.accenture.com/"},{"text":"Deloitte","url":"https://www.deloitte.com/"},{"text":"EY","url":"https://www.ey.com/"},{"text":"PwC","url":"https://www.pwc.com/"},{"text":"KPMG","url":"https://kpmg.com/"},{"text":"TCS","url":"https://www.tcs.com/"},{"text":"Infosys","url":"https://www.infosys.com/"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best internship target"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise internships with actual exposure to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel/Power BI","data cleaning","business analysis","reporting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than internships that only involve spreadsheet data entry."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning path","Why it matters"],"rows":[[{"text":"Microsoft Power BI / PL-300 pathway"},{"text":"Strong BI credential"}],[{"text":"NPTEL Data Analytics courses"},{"text":"Academic foundation"}],[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Core analyst skill"}],[{"text":"SQL certification/course"},{"text":"Database competency"}],[{"text":"Python for Data Analysis"},{"text":"Automation and analytics"}],[{"text":"Google Data Analytics pathway"},{"text":"Structured entry-level analytics learning"}],[{"text":"Tableau training/certification"},{"text":"Alternative BI ecosystem"}],[{"text":"Statistics / Business Analytics courses"},{"text":"Analytical foundation"}],[{"text":"Cloud analytics fundamentals"},{"text":"Future-facing capability"}],[{"text":"AI for Data Analytics"},{"text":"Productivity and modern analytics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI · NPTEL","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Certifications should support a portfolio rather than replace it."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the priority should generally be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL + Excel + Power BI + Statistics + Projects","Python","Certifications"]}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst Trainee"},{"text":"Business Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"MIS Analyst"},{"text":"MIS Executive"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Data Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Data Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Reporting & Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Data Operations Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Job-readiness matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + Excel + BI + statistics"},{"text":"End-to-end analytics project"}],[{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + data modelling"},{"text":"Power BI portfolio"}],[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + business knowledge + requirements"},{"text":"Business case studies"}],[{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + finance + BI"},{"text":"Financial dashboard"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + statistics + marketing metrics"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"}],[{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + experimentation + product metrics"},{"text":"Product analytics case"}],[{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Statistics + finance + SQL"},{"text":"Risk analytics project"}],[{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + SQL + process analysis"},{"text":"Operations dashboard"}],[{"text":"MIS Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + reporting + BI"},{"text":"Automated MIS project"}],[{"text":"Analytics Associate"},{"text":"SQL + Python + BI"},{"text":"Multi-tool portfolio"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analyst is a realistic target immediately after B.Com Computer Applications if the student develops the technical stack."},{"type":"p","text":"The degree alone is unlikely to be sufficient for competitive Data Analyst positions. Employers commonly expect evidence of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel","BI","analytical reasoning","business understanding."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Commerce + analytics/finance"}],[{"text":"M.Com Computer Applications / related pathway"},{"text":"Commerce + technology"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"Deeper technical analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Direct analytics specialisation"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Analytics"},{"text":"Applied analytics"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Analytics + management"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance + Analytics"},{"text":"Financial analytics"}],[{"text":"MBA FinTech"},{"text":"Finance + technology"}],[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Stronger computing foundation"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Data Science/Analytics"},{"text":"Advanced technical route where eligible"}],[{"text":"PhD Data Science/Statistics/Business Analytics"},{"text":"Research/academic career"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Is a master's mandatory?"},{"type":"p","text":"No."},{"type":"p","text":"For an entry-level Data Analyst role, a strong:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Computer Applications","SQL","Excel","Power BI","statistics","portfolio","internship"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"can be enough."},{"type":"p","text":"A master's becomes useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced analytics"},{"text":"Data science"},{"text":"Quantitative research"},{"text":"Analytics management"},{"text":"Academic careers"},{"text":"Technical career switching"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarships and research routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential routes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UGC fellowships"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Research assistantships"},{"text":"PMRF for eligible doctoral programmes"},{"text":"Institution-specific funding"},{"text":"Fulbright"},{"text":"DAAD"}]},{"type":"p","text":"PMRF · USIEF / Fulbright · DAAD India","url":"https://www.pmrf.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and funding should be verified for the exact programme and year."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystems","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"MIT, Carnegie Mellon, Columbia, NYU, University of Washington"},{"text":"University funding + Fulbright"},{"text":"Quantitative prerequisites"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Imperial, LSE, Warwick, Edinburgh, Manchester"},{"text":"Chevening + university funding"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Technical University of Munich, Mannheim, LMU Munich, RWTH Aachen"},{"text":"DAAD + university funding"},{"text":"ECTS and prerequisite subjects"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"University of Toronto, UBC, Waterloo, McGill"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Quantitative/programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Entry requirements"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Highly competitive admissions"}],[{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Trinity College Dublin, University College Dublin"},{"text":"Government/university funding"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"University examples are illustrative, not a ranking. Exact programme names, eligibility and fees should be verified for the intended intake."},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Recommendations"},{"text":"English-language test if required"},{"text":"GMAT/GRE if required"},{"text":"Analytics portfolio"},{"text":"GitHub profile"},{"text":"Internship certificates"},{"text":"Research/project documentation"},{"text":"Financial documents"},{"text":"Visa documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Computer Applications Student","Data Analytics Intern","Data Analyst Trainee / Analytics Associate","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Lead Data Analyst / Analytics Consultant","Analytics Lead / BI Lead","Analytics Manager / Data Strategy Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Product Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Financial Analyst","Senior Financial Analyst","Finance Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"A student interested in advanced research can pursue:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data/Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD Statistics"},{"text":"PhD Data Science"},{"text":"PhD Applied Mathematics"},{"text":"PhD Econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD Business Analytics"},{"text":"PhD Management Information Systems"},{"text":"PhD Operations Research"},{"text":"PhD Marketing Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance/economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD Finance"},{"text":"PhD Economics"},{"text":"Financial Econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI for business analytics"},{"text":"Explainable AI"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Automated analytics"},{"text":"Human-AI decision making"},{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"AI agents for enterprise analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2035–2046 career evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The Data Analyst role is likely to change substantially as natural-language analytics, AI agents and automated reporting become more capable."},{"type":"p","text":"The career should evolve from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Dashboard Builder","Data Interpreter","Decision Analyst","Analytics Strategist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future capabilities should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted SQL"},{"text":"Natural-language BI"},{"text":"Automated data cleaning"},{"text":"AI agents for analytics"},{"text":"Predictive modelling"},{"text":"Causal analysis"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Cloud data platforms"},{"text":"Analytics engineering"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"},{"text":"Responsible AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a commerce graduate, the strongest long-term positioning is particularly attractive:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Commerce","Business Domain","SQL","BI","Statistics","Python","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the student to specialise later in finance analytics, FinTech analytics, risk analytics, business intelligence, product analytics or general business analytics."}]}]}